cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "cvehound-rulegen"
abstract: >-
  A testbench and pipeline for generating CVEhound Coccinelle detection rules for
  Linux kernel CVEs with language models. Each candidate rule is judged by an
  oracle that runs it against the kernel's git history -- before and after the fix,
  at the introducing commit and at every stable backport -- with the same verdict
  machinery as the CVEhound test suite.
